
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>            <-- 72 chars max, imperative, no period
#
# <body>                                 <-- what and why, not how. wrap at 72.
#
# <footer>                               <-- BREAKING CHANGE:, Refs, Closes
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# types    feat  fix  perf  refactor  docs  test  build  ci  style  chore  revert
# scopes   core  render  providers  ipc  cli  daemon  skylight  config  docs  deps
#
# perf commits carry a before/after number in the body.
# breaking changes take a ! after the scope and a BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md.
